    "detailed_description": "<strong>WARNING:</strong> This video game may trigger seizures in people with photosensitive epilepsy. View at your own risk!<br><br><strong>Prison of Nightmare</strong> is a first-person psychological horror game.<br><br><strong>Prison of Nightmare</strong> is a first-person psychological horror game that immerses players in a haunting and oppressive atmosphere. The game revolves around an ancient dark entity, a malevolent spirit that invades the protagonist's dreams, aiming to terrorize and eventually capture their soul, trapping them in an eternal nightmare.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042090/extras/c11392ebf989dc3f928f2e8c2100375f.poster.avif?t=1724262170\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042090/extras/c11392ebf989dc3f928f2e8c2100375f.webm?t=1724262170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042090/extras/c11392ebf989dc3f928f2e8c2100375f.mp4?t=1724262170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2></h2>In <strong>Prison of Nightmare</strong>, players take on the role of a protagonist whose peaceful slumber is shattered by an ancient and malevolent spirit. This dark entity infiltrates their dreams, turning them into twisted and terrifying landscapes. The spirit's ultimate goal is to capture the protagonist's soul, dooming them to an eternity of nightmares. Players must navigate through these disturbing dreams, attempting to outwit the entity and escape its clutches.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Environment</h2></h2>The game's setting is a nightmarish dreamscape, distorted and terrifying due to the influence of the dark spirit. The environments are dynamic, with sudden changes and various anomalies occurring without warning. These surreal landscapes are designed to evoke a sense of dread and disorientation, with eerie, ever-changing visuals that keep players on edge. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042090/extras/9a2ae100b862f71d38b7dba077367e2d.poster.avif?t=1724262170\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042090/extras/9a2ae100b862f71d38b7dba077367e2d.webm?t=1724262170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042090/extras/9a2ae100b862f71d38b7dba077367e2d.mp4?t=1724262170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dark Entity</h2></h2>The central antagonist of <strong>Prison of Nightmare</strong> is a sinister spirit, an ancient dark entity with the power to manipulate dreams. This malevolent presence is the source of the game's horror, relentlessly pursuing the protagonist and creating horrifying scenarios within their dreams. The entity's influence warps the dream world, summoning terrifying apparitions and altering the environment in unpredictable ways, heightening the sense of fear and urgency.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2></h2><strong>Prison of Nightmare</strong> is a single-player game played from a first-person perspective. The gameplay combines exploration, puzzle-solving, and survival elements. Players must navigate through the protagonist's nightmarish dreams, solving intricate puzzles to progress and uncovering the story behind the dark entity. The game's realistic graphics and advanced lighting effects, along with its three-dimensional sound design, create a deeply immersive experience. Despite the oppressive and terrifying environment, players must keep a clear head to solve puzzles and find a way to escape the nightmare.<br><br>In <strong>Prison of Nightmare</strong>, the blend of psychological horror, immersive environments, and challenging puzzles ensures a gripping and terrifying experience, pushing players to confront their deepest fears within the twisted landscapes of a haunted mind.",
